## Why This Is Asked
Assess ability to fuse streaming and side-input state with time-based cache, manage deduplication, and preserve delivery guarantees in KCNA.

## Key Concepts
- KCNA join with side-input state
- TTL-based per-device deduplication
- Idempotent sink writes and at-least-once guarantees
- Late updates handling and offset management

